  <name>Trophy</name>
  <summary>2D car racing game with power-ups</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Trophy is a single-player racing game. Even though the goal is basically
      to finish the laps as the first, Trophy is an action game which offers
      much more than just a race.
    </p>
    <p>
      Trophy has lots of extras, which are... er... 'untypical' for racing
      games. Some of these "unusual" features for races are: shooting other
      players, putting mines and many others.
    </p>
  </description>
